#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid "Install TeX Live by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale o TeX Live executando os seguintes comandos:"

#.  Ken: comment biber - usually a new texyear has brought a new version
#.         but not so far for 2024. Looking at what it installs it is only
#. perl
#.         modules and their man pages so those ought to still exist after the
#.         previous year's texlive has been removed.
#.         <application>biber</application>,
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to upgrade to current <application>texlive</application> on an "
"older system where extra packages (<application>asymptote</application>, "
"<application>dvisvgm</application>, or <application>xindy</application>) "
"have been installed, you will need to reinstall those as well as fixing up "
"your <literal>PATH</literal> for <literal>$TEXLIVE_PREFIX</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar atualizar para o <application>texlive</application> atual em"
" um sistema mais antigo, onde pacotes extras "
"(<application>asymptote</application>, <application>dvisvgm</application> ou"
" <application>xindy</application>) tenham sido instalados, você precisará "
"reinstalá-los, bem como corrigir teu <literal>PATH</literal> para "
"<literal>$TEXLIVE_PREFIX</literal>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:263
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A successful install requires some texlive commands to be run as the root "
"user, so we will export the TEXARCH variable to let &root; use it."
msgstr ""
"Uma instalação bem-sucedida exige que alguns comandos do texlive sejam "
"executados como o(a) usuário(a) root, de forma que nós exportaremos a "
"variável TEXARCH para permitir que o(a) &root; a use."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:281
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as a normal user:"
msgstr "Agora, como um(a) usuário(a) normal:"

#.  if a patch for the source is needed, this should go between the export
#.         ande configure. But keeping it there as a commented line adds too
#. much vertical space.
#.     patch -Np1 -i ../texlive-&texlive-version;-source-security_fix-1.patch
#. &amp;&amp;
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:287
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export TEXARCH=$(uname -m | sed -e 's/i.86/i386/' -e 's/$/-linux/') &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"patch -Np1 -i ../texlive-&texlive-version;-source-upstream_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir texlive-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    texlive-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"../configure CC=\"gcc -std=gnu17\" -C               \\\n"
"    --prefix=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX                      \\\n"
"    --bindir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/bin/$TEXARCH         \\\n"
"    --datarootdir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX                 \\\n"
"    --includedir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/include          \\\n"
"    --infodir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/texmf-dist/doc/info \\\n"
"    --libdir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/lib                  \\\n"
"    --mandir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/texmf-dist/doc/man   \\\n"
"    --disable-native-texlive-build                \\\n"
"    --disable-static --enable-shared              \\\n"
"    --disable-dvisvgm                             \\\n"
"    --with-system-cairo                           \\\n"
"    --with-system-fontconfig                      \\\n"
"    --with-system-freetype2                       \\\n"
"    --with-system-gmp                             \\\n"
"    --with-system-graphite2                       \\\n"
"    --with-system-harfbuzz                        \\\n"
"    --with-system-icu                             \\\n"
"    --with-system-libpaper                        \\\n"
"    --with-system-libpng                          \\\n"
"    --with-system-mpfr                            \\\n"
"    --with-system-pixman                          \\\n"
"    --with-system-zlib                            \\\n"
"    --with-banner-add=\" - BLFS\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>export TEXARCH=$(uname -m | sed -e 's/i.86/i386/' -e 's/$/-linux/') &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"patch -Np1 -i ../texlive-&texlive-version;-source-upstream_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir texlive-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    texlive-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"../configure CC=\"gcc -std=gnu17\" -C               \\\n"
"    --prefix=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX                      \\\n"
"    --bindir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/bin/$TEXARCH         \\\n"
"    --datarootdir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX                 \\\n"
"    --includedir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/include          \\\n"
"    --infodir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/texmf-dist/doc/info \\\n"
"    --libdir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/lib                  \\\n"
"    --mandir=$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/texmf-dist/doc/man   \\\n"
"    --disable-native-texlive-build                \\\n"
"    --disable-static --enable-shared              \\\n"
"    --disable-dvisvgm                             \\\n"
"    --with-system-cairo                           \\\n"
"    --with-system-fontconfig                      \\\n"
"    --with-system-freetype2                       \\\n"
"    --with-system-gmp                             \\\n"
"    --with-system-graphite2                       \\\n"
"    --with-system-harfbuzz                        \\\n"
"    --with-system-icu                             \\\n"
"    --with-system-libpaper                        \\\n"
"    --with-system-libpng                          \\\n"
"    --with-system-mpfr                            \\\n"
"    --with-system-pixman                          \\\n"
"    --with-system-zlib                            \\\n"
"    --with-banner-add=\" - BLFS\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make</userinput>"

#.  https://github.com/rrthomas/libpaper/issues/43
#.  Still true with TL 2025
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:322
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make -k check</command>.  One test, "
"<filename>psutils.test</filename>, is known to fail if using system libpaper"
" because TeX Live includes old versions of both "
"<application>psutils</application> and <application>libpaper</application> "
"which result in a difference in the final decimal places of the psresize "
"test. The <application>libpaper</application> developer does not think this "
"is significant. Another test, <filename>xdvipdfm-pdf.test</filename>, is "
"known to fail due to a missing binary file from the upstream fixes patch. "
"This does not affect the functionality of the program."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make -k check</command>. Um "
"teste, <filename>psutils.test</filename>, é conhecido por falhar se usar a "
"libpaper do sistema, pois o TeX Live inclui versões antigas de ambos, "
"<application>psutils</application> e de <application>libpaper</application>,"
" o que resulta em uma diferença nas casas decimais finais do teste psresize."
" O(A) desenvolvedor(a) da <application>libpaper</application> não considera "
"que isso seja significativo. Outro teste, <filename>xdvipdfm-"
"pdf.test</filename>, é conhecido por falhar devido a um arquivo binário "
"ausente proveniente do remendo de correções do fluxo de desenvolvimento. "
"Isso não afeta a funcionalidade do programa."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:336
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#.  Editors, you can run 'make texlinks' in a DESTDIR by passing
#. DESTDIR=some/where
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:341
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install-strip &amp;&amp;\n"
"make texlinks      &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -pv                                $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg/TeXLive/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 ../texk/tests/TeXLive/* $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg/TeXLive/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -xf ../../texlive-&texlive-version;-extra.tar.xz -C $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg --strip-components=2</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install-strip &amp;&amp;\n"
"make texlinks      &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -pv                                $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg/TeXLive/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 ../texk/tests/TeXLive/* $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg/TeXLive/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -xf ../../texlive-&texlive-version;-extra.tar.xz -C $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg --strip-components=2</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:349
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Only run <command>make texlinks</command> once. If it is run again, it can "
"change all the program symlinks so that they point to themselves and are "
"useless."
msgstr ""
"Execute <command>make texlinks</command> somente uma vez. Se for executado "
"novamente, poderá mudar todos os linques simbólicos do programa, de modo que"
" eles apontem para eles mesmos e sejam inúteis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:356
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now install the additional files as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora instale os arquivos adicionais como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#.  if texmf does not need to be patched, remove &amp;&amp; from first line,
#.  close userinput, screen, comment pushd, patch, popd
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:362
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../../texlive-&texmf-version;-texmf.tar.xz -C "
"$TEXLIVE_PREFIX --strip-components=1</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../../texlive-&texmf-version;-texmf.tar.xz -C "
"$TEXLIVE_PREFIX --strip-components=1</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:365
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Still as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, "
"initialize the new system (the command <command>fmtutil-sys --all</command> "
"will produce a <emphasis>lot</emphasis> of output):"
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>,"
" inicialize o novo sistema (o comando <command>fmtutil-sys --all</command> "
"produzirá um <emphasis>monte</emphasis> de saída gerada):"

#.  Editors, fmtutil-sys can apparently only be run on
#. a real install, as root.  But mktexlsr can be run in a DESTDIR with
#. cd /YOUR/TEXMF/ROOT ; ls -LAR ./ >
#. ls-R
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:375
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mktexlsr &amp;&amp;\n"
"fmtutil-sys --all</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mktexlsr &amp;&amp;\n"
"fmtutil-sys --all</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:379
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To allow <xref linkend=\"evince\"/> or <xref linkend=\"dvisvgm\"/> to link "
"to <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libkpathsea.so</filename>, as the &root; "
"user (re)create a symlink from <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib</filename>:"
msgstr ""
"Para permitir que o <xref linkend=\"evince\"/>, ou o <xref "
"linkend=\"dvisvgm\"/>, se vincule a <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libkpathsea.so</filename>, como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;, (re)crie um link simbólico a partir de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:385
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -svf $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/lib/libkpathsea.so{,.6} "
"/usr/lib</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -svf $TEXLIVE_PREFIX/lib/libkpathsea.so{,.6} "
"/usr/lib</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:389
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"TeX Live does not include the source for ConTeXt, only the items that are at"
" CTAN. Trying to build ConTeXt purely from source on a BLFS TeX Live system "
"is a niche usage and looks as if it will be more trouble than it is worth."
msgstr ""
"O TeX Live não inclui o fonte para ConTeXt, somente os itens que estão no "
"CTAN. Tentar construir o ConTeXt puramente a partir do fonte em um sistema "
"TeX Live do BLFS é um uso de nicho e parece que será mais problemático do "
"que vale a pena."

#.  trying to use a filename tag here is rejected within para ??
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:396
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to use ConTeXt with <command>luametatex</command> (most of the "
"old MKII and MKIV code was removed from TeX Live 2023 by the ConTeXt "
"developer), starting with the binary (only installing ConTeXt, 753 MB in "
"March 2024) would probably be the easiest way to bootstrap it. The source "
"for <command>luametatex</command> can be pulled with git from <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/contextgarden/luametatex/tags\">github "
"luametatex</ulink>, compiled with meson and ninja, and installed by copying "
"to the correct program directory. This should avoid having to fix all the "
"symlinks etc and also avoid including the many unrelated parts of texmf-"
"dist.  See comments 1 to 5 of <ulink url=\"&blfs-ticket-"
"root;17823\">#17823</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar usar o ConTeXt com <command>luametatex</command> (a maior "
"parte do antigo código do MKII e MKIV foi removido do TeX Live 2023 pelo(a) "
"desenvolvedor(a) do ConTeXt), começando com o binário (somente instalando o "
"ConTeXt, 753 MB em março de 2024 ) provavelmente seria a maneira mais fácil "
"de inicializá-lo. O fonte para <command>luametatex</command> pode ser "
"extraída com git a partir de <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/contextgarden/luametatex/tags\">github "
"luametatex</ulink>, compilado com meson e ninja, e instalado copiando-se "
"para o diretório correto do programa. Isso deveria evitar ter-se que "
"corrigir todos os links simbólicos, etc., e também evitar incluir as muitas "
"partes não relacionadas do texmf-dist. Vejam-se os comentários 1 a 5 de "
"<ulink url=\"&blfs-ticket-root;17823\">#17823</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:413
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can now proceed to <xref linkend=\"asymptote\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"biber\"/>, <xref linkend=\"dvisvgm\"/> and / or <xref "
"linkend=\"xindy\"/> if you wish to install them."
msgstr ""
"Agora você pode prosseguir para <xref linkend=\"asymptote\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"biber\"/>, <xref linkend=\"dvisvgm\"/> e (ou) <xref "
"linkend=\"xindy\"/> se desejar instalá-los."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:421
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:424
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>-C</command>: creates config.cache, which saves significant time in"
" a parallel build."
msgstr ""
"<command>-C</command>: cria config.cache, o que economiza tempo "
"significativo em uma construção paralela."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:444
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-dvisvgm</parameter>: As noted above, the shipped "
"version of dvisvgm, which has modified configuration files, cannot be built "
"with shared system libraries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-dvisvgm</parameter>: Conforme observado acima, a versão"
" enviada do dvisvgm, que tem arquivos modificados de configuração, não pode "
"ser construída com bibliotecas de sistema compartilhadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:450
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>make texlinks</command> : this runs the texlinks.sh script to "
"create symbolic links from formats to engines.  In practice, several of the "
"targets such as <command>xetex</command> are now separate binaries and for "
"these it will report \"file already exists\"."
msgstr ""
"<command>make texlinks</command> : isso executa o conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais texlinks.sh para criar links simbólicos de formats para engines."
" Na prática, vários dos alvos, como o <command>xetex</command>, agora são "
"binários separados e para esses ele informará \"file already exists\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:457
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>tar -xf texlive-&texmf-version;-texmf.tar.xz -C $TEXLIVE_PREFIX "
"--strip-components=1</command>: this tarball contains the files for the "
"texmf-dist directory, and because of its size we do not want to waste time "
"and space untarring it and then copying the files."
msgstr ""
"<command>tar -xf texlive-&texmf-version;-texmf.tar.xz -C $TEXLIVE_PREFIX "
"--strip-components=1</command>: esse tarball contém os arquivos para o "
"diretório texmf-dist e, devido ao tamanho dele, nós não queremos desperdiçar"
" tempo e espaço desempacotando-o e depois copiando os arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:464
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m644 ../texk/tests/TeXLive/* "
"$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg/TeXLive/</command>: This puts the perl modules "
"<filename>TLConfig.pm</filename> and <filename>TLUtils.pm</filename> into "
"the directory where the binary installer puts them - it is at the start of "
"the perl @INC@ PATH within texlive when installed using the above configure "
"switches. Without these modules, texlive is unusable."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m644 ../texk/tests/TeXLive/* "
"$TEXLIVE_PREFIX/tlpkg/TeXLive/</command>: Isso coloca os módulos do Perl "
"<filename>TLConfig.pm</filename> e <filename>TLUtils.pm</filename> no "
"diretório onde o instalador do binário os coloca - está no início do PATH "
"@INC@ do Perl dentro do texlive quando instalado usando as chaves de "
"configuração acima. Sem esses módulos, o texlive não é usável."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:473
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>mktexlsr</command>: Creates an <filename>ls-R</filename> file which"
" lists what was installed - this is used by kpathsea to find files."
msgstr ""
"<command>mktexlsr</command>: Cria um arquivo <filename>ls-R</filename> que "
"lista o que foi instalado - isso é usado pelo kpathsea para encontrar "
"arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:478
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>fmtutil-sys --all</command>: This initializes the TeX formats, "
"Metafont bases and Metapost mems."
msgstr ""
"<command>fmtutil-sys --all</command>: Isso inicializa os formatos do TeX, "
"bases Metafont e memorandos Metapost."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:483
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--without-x</option>: Use this option if you do not have Xorg "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>--without-x</option>: Use essa opção se você não tiver o Xorg "
"instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/typesetting/texlive.xml:487
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many other '--disable' or '--without' options. Some of them such "
"as <option>--without-texinfo</option> are accepted but no longer do "
"anything, others will prevent a program being built - but the far greater "
"amount of space used for the related items in texmf means there is no "
"obvious benefit from disabling a few of the programs."
msgstr ""
"Existem muitas outras opções '--disable' ou '--without'. Algumas delas, como"
" <option>--without-texinfo</option>, são aceitas, mas não mais fazem nada; "
"outras impedirão um aplicativo de ser construído - mas a quantidade muito "
"maior de espaço usado para os itens relacionados no texmf significa que não "
"existe nenhum benefício óbvio em desabilitar alguns dos aplicativos."

